        "providence-day:trips.alsoOnRecord[3].text"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "Aprantisaj mondyal la kòmanse nan TK ak \"TK Goes Global\" ak echanj videyo Round Square; vwayaj aletranje yo louvri nan Middle School epi yo elaji nan Upper School.",
