    {
      "t": "Yon gradye pwomosyon 2025 la, kounye a nan Columbia University, ki \"had never left the United States\" lè li te kòmanse 9yèm ane — e depi lè sa a li \"jumped off cliffs in Wales, met with students from Japan at Oxford University, and explored La Alhambra in Spain.\"",
